    "operator_authorized_floor_note": "2026-10-01: 2 GiB is residual reserve after deploy/cleanup, not a fixed start gate. Pre-transfer admission is dynamic: compressed image + exact unpacked Docker image + two bundles + private SQLite scratch growth (512 MiB minus identified residence) + live SHADOW growth (128 MiB minus bounded verified residence) + private archive growth (512 MiB minus bounded verified residence) + one shared 2 GiB residual reserve per filesystem. DATA storage independently admits source MAIN/WAL/reconstructed SHM, all three derived growth budgets and free inodes. Canonical derived roots must share the DATA filesystem. Archive/live inventory proves metadata and custody only; CRC, logical semantics, recovery and the nine-hour horizon remain producer/reader gates. On space RED, safe cleanup runs before frozen-artifact transfer and both gates are re-evaluated."
  },
